{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_backlog_backlog", "label": "AtlasJS Unified Backlog", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single list of everything not yet done, grouped by domain, each item pointing back to its source design doc; statuses are \ud83d\udccb not implemented / \ud83d\udd36 partial / \ud83d\udcad vision."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_a2_text_rendering", "label": "A2 \u2014 Text rendering", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bitmap/MSDF font as a built-in \"text\" shader plus glyph batch, plugging in as a Batcher on the NodeRenderer seam (E3)."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_a3_post_processing", "label": "A3 \u2014 Post-processing stack", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chained passes (bloom, vignette) on an offscreen RenderTarget; the render-to-texture hook already exists and is verified."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_b1_resource_lifecycle_eviction", "label": "B1 \u2014 Resource lifecycle / eviction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Caches (batchIds, bind-group/shader/pipeline, instancedPipelines) grow without eviction and destroy() is never called at teardown \u2192 leaks. Blocks refcounting in the asset system."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_b2_editor_nebula_reconciliation", "label": "B2 \u2014 Editor \u2194 nebula reconciliation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "packages/editor targets a diverged nebula API that no longer compiles (RectNode, Node.position/scale, private Node.parent, missing Camera2D methods); partially unblocked by Camera2D.screenToWorld/worldToScreen."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_b4_depth_test_3d", "label": "B4 \u2014 3D depth test", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "RenderState.depthTest / PassDescriptor.depth are inert yet already part of the pipeline cache keys \u2014 a silent trap; low priority while the engine is 2D-first."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_archetype_soa_backend", "label": "Archetype / SoA storage backend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The swappable IComponentStore seam exists precisely to make this migration painless, but the implementation is still sparse-set only."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_changed_change_detection", "label": "Changed<T> tick-based change detection", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bevy-style primitive intended to replace every residual manual diff; it is the hard dependency of B3 (killing the last Transform fa\u00e7ade)."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_phase3_physics_dt", "label": "Scheduling Phase 3 \u2014 Physics dt", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PhysicsWorld.step(dt) + world.timestep = dt is the single unfinished phase of the scheduling refactor."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_c7_pixel_perfect_smooth_scroll", "label": "C7 \u2014 Pixel-perfect smooth scroll", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Render the world to a low-res render target at integer scale then upscale with a sub-pixel blit offset (Celeste technique) to get smoothness AND crispness, where pixelSnap alone advances the camera in 1px steps."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_camera_pixel_snap", "label": "Camera2D.pixelSnap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Snaps the view matrix translation to the device grid 1/(zoom\u00b7dpr) to kill sub-pixel jitter and 1px tile seams, while keeping camera.position continuous so screenToWorld/follow are unaffected."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_named_sorting_layers", "label": "Named sorting layers + order-in-layer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cross-cutting render feature touching SpriteRender, TileMapRenderer and NodeRendererBase.computeSortKey (free bits available) \u2014 to be designed separately, not as a tilemap feature."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_tilemap_colliders", "label": "Tilemap colliders", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A component generating @atlasjs/rapier colliders from filled cells; depends on a gameplay-side 2D collision model."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_custom_typescript_compiler", "label": "Custom TypeScript compiler", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One compiler serves both roadmaps: rewriting addComponent<T>(a,b) \u2192 addComponent(T,a,b), generating registerScriptMetadata, linking TProps \u2194 metadata, and inlining token resolution to remove runtime dispatch."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_b3_transform_pure_data", "label": "B3 \u2014 Transform as pure data", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Killing the last fa\u00e7ade needs Changed<T>; the dragon is that teleporting a dynamic body cannot be a raw Transform write (clobbered next frame by the dynamic-only pull), so an explicit channel like rigidBody.teleport() is required."}, {"id": "docs_backlog_technical_debt_dino_brawl_tsc", "label": "Technical debt \u2014 dino-brawl tsc -b red", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "4 pre-existing noUnusedLocals/noUnusedParameters errors in legacy non-ECS Player.ts and Sword.ts; unrelated to any design workstream."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_backlog_backlog", "target": "docs_backlog_a2_text_rendering", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backlog_backlog", "target": "docs_backlog_a3_post_processing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backlog_backlog", "target": "docs_backlog_b1_resource_lifecycle_eviction", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backlog_backlog", "target": "docs_backlog_b2_editor_nebula_reconciliation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backlog.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backlog_backlog", "target": "docs_backlog_b4